  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Str or Dex, +1 Con\nSpeed: 30 feet.\nSkill Proficiencies: Survival, Animal Handling\nWeapon Proficiencies: You are proficient with Katana’s, Broadswords and Odachi.  Tool Proficiencies: Poisoner’s Kit.\nHebi Clan Jutsu: The Hebi have access to a separate list of Jutsu unique to their Clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the Normal jutsu list.\nHijutsu Flexibility: Hebi Clan Hijutsu can use either Strength or Constitution as its casting ability score.\nSnake Speech: Hebi Clansmen are known for their affinity with snakes. You can communicate with and understand snakes and reptiles.\nSnake Mimicry: Your heritage and history with your clans snakes has granted you enhanced senses. You have 10 feet of Tremor sense.",
